UnisonShifts: [ss(`GDAE`)] +[ss(`3 4 5 6 7`)]sem
-=- vibrato
Vibrato: [ss(`12345678`)]:computed [zipT(zipT(...divide(frets(10), 4).map(shuffle)).map(shuffle).flat(), shuffleX(ss(`↑↓↑↓`), 4)).map(x=>x.join(''))]:show-4 spitze narrow [metroS(42, 4)]metro:show-1:inline [`14f`]nextDisable:hide
